				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1137,
				1
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Enforce explicit Fn path for ExtensionInstall\n\nUpdate the import in `ExtensionInstall.rs` to use the fully qualified path `UriComponents::FromFilePath::Fn` instead of the module alias `UriFromFilePath`.\n\nThis change aligns the extension installation handler with the project's strict `Struct::Struct` and `Fn` naming conventions, ensuring all function calls are explicit and removing implicit module re-exports. This maintains consistency with recent refactoring efforts in `FileRealpath` and other IPC handlers that migrate inline types and functions to dedicated PascalCase modules, reducing ambiguity in the Wind service handler layer.",
			"SHA": "40e5b9780834547f1338ff3c4a23c7b42ec4abff"
		}
